News: Don't blame me for it having glitches, it's buggy Roblox updates. If you are in a server that doesn't have V35.3.0 at the bottom, you are on an old server. There is no lag at all, but if a server is slow, keep going to differnet ones. There will always be at least one that is fast. Comments are disabled because of spammers and advertisers. If you have any suggestions, please pm me. ProBloxx made the first Destruction Derby on Roblox. Thanks to Aliali and themanofbrick for the police car (I made it crashable though)." /><meta id="ctl00_metakeywords" name="keywords" content="virtual good Destruction Derby V35.3.0 *READ DESCRIPTION*, a Free Game by Tiger370 - ROBLOX (updated 4/2/2010 7:07:46 AM) items, ROBLOX Destruction Derby V35.3.0 *READ DESCRIPTION*, a Free Game by Tiger370 - ROBLOX (updated 4/2/2010 7:07:46 AM)" />

